{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07505","headline":"题曲阿三昧王佛殿前孤石 · 刘长卿","name":"题曲阿三昧王佛殿前孤石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤石自何处，对之疑旧游。\n氛氲岘首夕，苍翠剡中秋。\n迥出羣峰当殿前，雪山灵鹫慙贞坚。\n一片孤云长不去，莓苔古色空苍然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07505.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07505","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}